{
 "_what": "Property tables for the transitions Builder 2 ported, 2026-09-20. SEAM-ROOM and DURATION are the two dials on every one, per Zac: `seamRoom` is where the hard cut sits inside the item (frames from its start), `duration` is how long the transition runs, centred on that seam.",
 "_one_source": "Both sides are the SAME asset at two offsets \u2014 in this pipeline every clip is a seek into one file, which is exactly the two-video-layer capability measured by frame on 2026-09-19. `clip` is one asset id; `srcFromA` and `srcFromB` are the two source offsets.",
 "_contract": "Every key here is READ by the built blob and every props.x the blob reads is declared here. No hardcoded fallbacks: defaults live here and nowhere else.",
